  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1102.04 Visible Emissions Requirements for Gasoline-Powered Motor Vehicles",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1102.04 Visible Emissions Requirements for Gasoline-Powered Motor Vehicles. No person shall operate a gasoline-powered motor vehicle that emits visible emissions other than water vapor or steam, except during the initial starting of the engine.\n\nSource. #10345, eff 5-22-13; ss by #13680, eff 7-1-23\n\nAppendix",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1100.html"
